WEBVTT

00:00:32.620 --> 00:00:34.890
Go ahead and kill me!

00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:41.830
So you're giving up the fight, and you call yourself a warrior?

00:00:42.030 --> 00:00:45.000
But our planet has been destroyed.

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:48.400
True, but you yourself have not been defeated.

00:00:51.110 --> 00:00:52.870
Come with me now.

00:00:53.010 --> 00:00:57.280
If you want to live as a warrior, and die as a warrior as well!

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:13.170
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:16.070
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:23.030
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:23.420 --> 00:01:27.070
Rise in fury, Steel Cyborg!

00:01:29.190 --> 00:01:33.790
With your red mane and golden arms!

00:01:35.110 --> 00:01:38.070
Your G-Stone sparkling in the sun...

00:01:38.070 --> 00:01:42.990
All the world's hope is in your hands.

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:46.910
Your time has come to make a stand!

00:01:46.910 --> 00:01:49.710
Crushing the hopes of the people...

00:01:49.710 --> 00:01:53.470
The Zonders will pay the price!

00:01:55.620 --> 00:01:58.470
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:58.470 --> 00:02:01.640
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:01.640 --> 00:02:04.180
Final Fusion, approved!

00:02:04.380 --> 00:02:07.310
Now transform into a superhero!

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:10.270
Warping dimensional space!

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:14.350
Dividing Driver!

00:02:16.170 --> 00:02:21.990
A miracle! A mystery! The truth! A dream!

00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:27.870
A gigantic, invincible guardian is born!

00:02:27.870 --> 00:02:30.820
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:30.820 --> 00:02:34.710
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:34.180 --> 00:02:36.770
This is the story of the brave men and women...

00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:39.750
...who fight with all their hearts to save mankind.

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:42.140
The Misty Valley

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:44.970
<i>The Misty Valley</i>

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:54.070
How can it be so huge...

00:02:54.150 --> 00:02:55.610
...and yet so fast?

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:02.410
Where's it heading now?

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:08.040
No good, I can't possibly catch up!

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:09.370
Awaiting your next orders...

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:10.540
Chief!

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:12.920
I'd like you to stay on patrol.

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:15.630
You've got to find out what the Zonder is after, no matter what it takes!

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:16.840
Roger!

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:18.970
Third time around now, eh?

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:24.180
A C-11 U.S. military transport plane headed from Okinawa to Yokosuka...

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:26.260
...disappeared in this area here.

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:30.440
And after Zonderizing, it was spotted for the first time right here.

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:33.600
And then a second time, and a third...

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:36.860
And it's showing up in completely different areas every time.

00:03:37.070 --> 00:03:40.030
If there's a connection, I don't see it...

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:42.280
Just what are they trying to accomplish?

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:53.580
This is my first time ever in a cable car!

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:55.170
Waha! Same for me!

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:57.920
This is my first time, too... in JAPAN.

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:01.840
When I was staying at our villa in Switzerland...

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:04.550
...I got a full view of the Alps from cable cars!

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:06.300
Oh, my, you lucky thing!

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:10.020
When I was in Switzerland we chartered a helicopter...

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:13.560
...so I never got the chance to ride with the commoners on a cable car!

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:22.530
Hey, look! There's the ocean!

00:04:22.650 --> 00:04:24.410
Where's G-Island City?

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:26.820
I guess we're up too high to see that far...

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:31.410
Let me take a picture with my cutting-edge computer-controlled...

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:34.250
...88x zoom lens digital camera!

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:38.500
Of course, a TRUE camera buff would just keep it simple.

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:41.170
All those bells and whistles just get in the way, know what I mean?

00:04:51.430 --> 00:04:52.930
Just look at that thick fog!

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:54.810
You can't see a thing!

00:05:03.950 --> 00:05:05.110
Hey...

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:07.740
I don't see the guys who got off the cable car ahead of us anywhere!

00:05:07.820 --> 00:05:09.950
I don't see the station guy either...

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:12.200
This is kind of creepy, isn't it?

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:16.120
Huh?

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:20.710
What should we do?

00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:25.970
Hold on, let me contact the teacher with my cutting-edge cell phone...

00:05:26.630 --> 00:05:29.390
I can't believe you have to carry your phone around everywhere...

00:05:29.510 --> 00:05:32.890
Why don't you get a life? You loser!

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:38.480
No good, all I'm getting is a lot of static!

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:40.900
Don't tell me...

00:05:47.150 --> 00:05:49.490
What's that sound? Is it a Caterpillar?

00:05:55.660 --> 00:05:57.870
I-It's... it's a tank!

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.000
Way cool!

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:01.340
I've never seen one of those for real before!

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:06.510
It's a state-of-the-art U.S. Army mobile combat vehicle, the M-7 McAuliffe!

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:09.390
Watch out!

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:18.270
Why are we running away from a tank on a field trip, for crying out loud?

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:19.690
Hey, don't ask me!

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:23.520
We came this close to being smashed into pieces!

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:25.360
I don't wanna be in pieces!

00:06:25.690 --> 00:06:27.030
Then you've got to run!

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:29.950
But I'm totally wiped out now...

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:33.030
Ouch...

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:39.710
Reika!

00:06:39.790 --> 00:06:41.130
Reika!

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:44.670
It's a boobytrap!

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:46.050
A boobytrap?

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:48.380
My big brother told me about these things once.

00:06:48.510 --> 00:06:52.850
They're traps that guerillas set for their enemies during wartime!

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:09.240
Is it still coming?

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:15.160
That McAuliffe was designed to perform on any battlefield in the world.

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:19.040
No mountain trail's gonna stop that thing from following us!

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:26.920
Is this some kind of Zonder trap?

00:07:27.550 --> 00:07:30.840
But I didn't sense any Zonders from that tank.

00:07:35.430 --> 00:07:36.180
Takayasu!

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:37.430
Takayasu!

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:39.390
Takayasu!

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:49.860
It's no good, we gotta run or we'll be riddled with bullets!

00:07:53.320 --> 00:07:56.740
All right! Let's get to that bridge. The tank'll be too heavy to cross!

00:07:56.870 --> 00:07:57.620
Hurry!

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:01.580
Come on, hurry!

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:12.170
What? An AH-69 Anaconda, a state- of-the-art U.S. military chopper?

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:20.310
Ushi!

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:37.700
Sorry, Hana!

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:06.060
EnRyu? Or is that HyoRyu?

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:08.980
Until I return, please wait for me here.

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:16.070
Wait, was that the robot named...

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:17.660
...Volfogg?

00:09:31.550 --> 00:09:33.550
I am the one you should be engaging!

00:09:45.980 --> 00:09:47.020
Over here!

00:09:56.110 --> 00:09:58.070
Holographic camouflage...

00:09:58.160 --> 00:10:02.080
Achieved by bending light, it lets Volfogg blend into his surroundings.

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:04.620
It is a power unique to Volfogg!

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:08.080
Over here!

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:39.530
Plugging away at your war game again, Dave?

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:42.580
Just give it up, man.

00:10:42.660 --> 00:10:44.910
We're just the lowly Transportation Unit.

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:47.410
Playing a game like that won't get you anywhere.

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:50.290
Besides, even if there was a war going on...

00:10:50.420 --> 00:10:53.210
...they'd just send slowpokes like you to Logistics.

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:56.460
Either that, or you'd be our first casualty!

00:11:06.310 --> 00:11:07.640
Darn those guys!

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:09.810
If we were at war right now...

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:11.940
And if I were the General...

00:11:12.020 --> 00:11:16.110
You can just bet that I'd get us an absolute victory!

00:11:16.280 --> 00:11:19.280
That wish of yours, would you like me to grant it?

00:11:23.030 --> 00:11:24.870
From this moment on, you're the General in charge.

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:30.660
Now, go on and start the war you've always dreamed of waging!

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:56.940
Do you mean this is the situation for the entire Hakone area?

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:03.200
I've just digitized the satellite images.

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:06.990
Those white areas you see are impregnable to signals from the...

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:09.580
...entire frequency zone, never mind infrared and x-ray scanning.

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:15.580
No wonder I've stopped receiving transmissions from Volfogg!

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:22.340
Mystery solved at last...

00:12:22.470 --> 00:12:24.470
It's Mamoru that the Zonders are really after!

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:26.100
Are you serious?

00:12:26.220 --> 00:12:27.680
Then what about that transport plane?

00:12:27.810 --> 00:12:28.560
It's a red herring.

00:12:28.640 --> 00:12:29.390
There's no doubt...

00:12:29.470 --> 00:12:32.600
They want to divert our attention from Hakone for as long as possible!

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:35.810
We've got to do something or Mamoru's life will be in danger!

00:12:37.270 --> 00:12:41.320
Utsugi! Summon Gai back from patrol, send him to Hakone ASAP!

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:42.030
Yes, sir!

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:46.370
Hyuuma, I'm dispatching you to Hakone by land...

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:48.080
...with HyoRyu and EnRyu under your command!

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:48.910
Gotcha!

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:52.790
I must steer them as far from Special Agent Mamoru as possible...

00:12:54.420 --> 00:12:56.630
System Change!

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:06.930
Volfogg!

00:13:20.110 --> 00:13:22.360
Do you really believe you have me cornered now?

00:13:26.860 --> 00:13:30.700
The fog generated by the Zonder is capable of blocking transmissions.

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:34.410
Once he realized this, Volfogg was able to summon the A.I. -equipped...

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:39.130
...GGG Gun Machines by causing his sirens to echo throughout the fog.

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:42.050
GunGlue, ascend!

00:13:46.130 --> 00:13:47.220
GunDober, let's go!

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:49.300
All components, system Change!

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:08.240
Iron Collar, launch!

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:19.460
Let's go!

00:14:31.050 --> 00:14:32.890
I believe we're far away enough now...

00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:50.070
I should give you more credit...

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:52.740
I didn't expect you to head us off by anticipating our moves.

00:14:52.910 --> 00:14:54.080
However!

00:14:56.660 --> 00:15:00.790
You've miscalculated our fighting capacity, therein lies your defeat!

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:03.000
Three Become One!

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:17.470
Big Volfogg!

00:15:17.810 --> 00:15:18.890
What?

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:25.980
Roar, my Murasame Sword!

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:28.990
4,000 Magnum!

00:15:34.240 --> 00:15:37.660
The Deadly Art of the Body-split!

00:15:52.300 --> 00:15:54.180
Silver Moon!

00:15:58.930 --> 00:16:01.230
Silver Cross!

00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:18.240
Finishing move, Whirling Death Strike!

00:16:48.730 --> 00:16:49.900
A suicide attack?

00:16:56.070 --> 00:16:57.870
My on-board Mirror Coating is...

00:16:57.990 --> 00:17:01.540
...sufficient protection against such a low-scale explosion.

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:16.720
The Zonder that had fused itself to the transport plane...

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:19.430
...was now absorbing the wreckage of the tanks and helicopters...

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:23.390
...and evolving into a Zonder Soldier from Hell.

00:17:23.640 --> 00:17:25.350
Detecting traces of Elementary Particle Z0!

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:27.730
Now confirming target as the main Zonder unit!

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:30.400
Casting away your mask at long last, are you?

00:17:35.610 --> 00:17:36.860
Was that an explosion?

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:38.780
A Zonder!

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:42.660
No way, don't tell me Volfogg's in combat!

00:18:00.050 --> 00:18:03.350
We're getting too close to Special Agent Mamoru's hiding place...

00:18:03.470 --> 00:18:06.140
I have no choice but to put an end to this as soon as possible.

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:11.190
No! Special Agent Mamoru!

00:18:14.690 --> 00:18:15.900
It's too dangerous for you here!

00:18:19.660 --> 00:18:21.280
Mirror Coating!

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:47.270
GaoGaiGar!

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:51.610
Are you all right?

00:18:52.440 --> 00:18:54.440
You came just in time, GaoGaiGar.

00:19:00.450 --> 00:19:03.530
Big Volfogg, I want you to take Mamoru to safety.

00:19:03.910 --> 00:19:04.910
Roger!

00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:22.300
You're after a kid, but you armed yourself to the teeth with weapons?

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:23.760
That's totally unforgivable!

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:40.200
No good! My sensors can't cut through this fog!

00:19:40.490 --> 00:19:43.120
Where is he? Where the heck is he?

00:19:46.790 --> 00:19:50.960
Level 99, unaimed launch, erasure target, fog!

00:19:52.870 --> 00:19:54.670
Eraser Head!

00:20:07.470 --> 00:20:08.430
Okay, found you!

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:15.480
Don't even think about getting away this time!

00:20:18.020 --> 00:20:19.820
You really believe...

00:20:22.150 --> 00:20:24.780
...you can bring down GaoGaiGar with this?

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:32.040
Protect Shade!

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:02.900
Gotcha!

00:21:03.400 --> 00:21:06.410
Hell and Heaven!

00:21:10.080 --> 00:21:11.750
Gemu, giru, gan, go, gufo!

00:21:34.680 --> 00:21:36.350
Now, then, Special Agent Mamoru...

00:21:36.440 --> 00:21:37.100
Okay!

00:21:37.310 --> 00:21:39.690
Coctura!

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:04.210
Um, Volfogg... that was your name, right?

00:22:04.510 --> 00:22:07.550
Yes. And at this moment I am Big Volfogg.

00:22:10.510 --> 00:22:12.350
Mamoru!

00:22:12.470 --> 00:22:13.560
Hana!

00:22:14.600 --> 00:22:15.390
Hey!

00:22:16.430 --> 00:22:18.060
Volfogg!

00:22:20.900 --> 00:22:23.440
But I didn't get a chance to thank you...

00:22:28.780 --> 00:22:31.990
Volfogg, of the GGG Intelligence Unit...

00:22:32.160 --> 00:22:34.910
A robot possessing a number of special powers...

00:22:35.080 --> 00:22:39.750
But we must wait until the next episode to discover all of them...

00:22:46.610 --> 00:22:50.510
You come floating down onto my planet.

00:22:51.710 --> 00:22:55.380
That's the dream I always have.

00:22:56.780 --> 00:23:01.560
Now you're looking up at the sky again...

00:23:01.560 --> 00:23:06.350
and you're searching for me.

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:10.520
Longing to see you and be with you...

00:23:11.690 --> 00:23:17.450
I know I feel it just as strongly as you.

00:23:19.510 --> 00:23:24.210
Give us the wings to fly

00:23:24.210 --> 00:23:28.870
and set off into the galaxy.

00:23:29.560 --> 00:23:34.210
When you and I are grown up...

00:23:34.210 --> 00:23:41.110
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:45.820 --> 00:23:48.990
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:49.150 --> 00:23:52.240
The secret GGG Base Station has fallen into the clutches of a Zonder!

00:23:52.320 --> 00:23:54.530
HyoRyu and EnRyu are out of commission!

00:23:54.700 --> 00:23:57.330
And GaoGaiGar is unable to go for Final Fusion!

00:23:57.410 --> 00:23:59.870
Does GGG's, no, all of mankind's hope...

00:23:59.960 --> 00:24:03.120
...rest on the battle to be waged by Volfogg and Mamoru?

00:24:03.380 --> 00:24:05.380
Next episode of GaoGaiGar, King of Braves...

00:24:05.500 --> 00:24:07.090
"GGG in the Cross-hairs"

00:24:06.750 --> 00:24:10.420
GGG in the Cross-hairs

00:24:07.210 --> 00:24:10.470
Make sure you stay tuned for the order..."Final Fusion Approved!"

00:24:12.430 --> 00:24:15.390
Kohsuke Entohji

00:24:13.470 --> 00:24:14.890
This is the Key to Victory!
